@startuml Sequence Diagram - Payment Creation
title A - Creacion de Pago (pendiente + webhook)
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #666666
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #666666

participant "Comercio" as Comercio
participant "KitPagos\n(Facade)" as Facade
participant "Adapter\n(seleccionado por\nGatewayFactory)" as Adapter
participant "Pasarela" as Pasarela

Comercio -> Facade : createPayment(request)
Facade -> Adapter : createPayment(request)
Adapter -> Pasarela : POST /payments (nativo)
Pasarela --> Adapter : 201 Created\n(estado nativo = pendiente, token)
Adapter --> Facade : rawResponse
Facade -> Facade : ResponseNormalizer.normalize(rawResponse, gateway)
Facade --> Comercio : Transaction(PENDING)

note over Comercio, Pasarela
  Este flujo NO entrega el resultado final del pago.
  La confirmacion (APROBADO, RECHAZADO, etc.) llega
  despues mediante un webhook: ver diagrama
  "Sequence Diagram - Webhook Conciliation".
end note

@enduml
